Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:02:00.04,Warning,,0,0,0,,{\fscx0\fscy0\clip(0,0,0,0)\org(0,0)}Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode.\NSubtitles will likely not function properly.\NPlease use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv:\Nhttps://mpv.io
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What? They rushed off of the island? - OG}What? They rushed off the island?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.35,0:01:59.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. We couldn't even\Ngive them our gift.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.47,0:02:01.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How disappointing... - OG}What a pity...{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.98,0:02:07.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I wonder if they even realize how\Nmuch we appreciate what they did. - OG}I wonder if they even realize\Nhow grateful we are for what they did.{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.32,0:02:13.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Exactly. They have no idea how I feel. - OG}Indeed. They still don't\Ngrasp our feelings.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.53,0:02:18.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not fair, Aisa...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.41,0:02:20.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{that you alone\Ngot to say goodbye to them. - OG}You're the only one who got\Nto say goodbye to them.{Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.83,0:02:24.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Everyone's in an uproar that\Nwe let our saviors run away. - OG}They can't stop talking about\Nhow we let our saviors run away.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.88,0:02:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But Luffy and the others\Ntold me not to tell anyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.34,0:02:34.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey Raki, did you know?\NLuffy's body stretches! - OG}Hey Raki, did you know that\NLuffy's body stretches?!{Naoto+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.93,0:02:37.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'd be like, "Gum-Gum Pistol!" {OG}{He'd shout, "Gum-Gum Pistol!" - Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Aisa, don't move! - OG}Hey, Aisa, hold still!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.43,0:02:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I didn't know there was a strong\Nwarrior like him in the Blue Sea, too. - OG}Who knew there was a strong\Nwarrior in the Blue Sea, too?!{PP+Gord+Polly, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.02,0:02:48.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanna be like him,\Nlike "Gum-Gum...!"
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.57,0:02:56.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Let's just trim your hair for\Ntoday. Let your hair grow. - OG}Let's just give it a trim for today.\NYou should let your hair grow out.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.03,0:02:56.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.86,0:03:01.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll look good on you.\NYou're a girl, so you should look cute.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.83,0:03:06.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cute?! Me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.67,0:03:08.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's right... - OG}That's right!{Spicy}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.04,0:03:12.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{since there won't be any need\Nfor you kids to carry arms... - OG}Now that there's no need\Nfor you kids to carry weapons...{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.63,0:03:19.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{and since you can now live freely,\Nlike people in the sky should. - OG}you can live freely,\Nlike people in the sky should.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.14,0:03:23.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You're ladylike today. - OG}You sure are ladylike today!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.52,0:03:27.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Now, don't move, Aisa! - OG}Now, hold still, Aisa!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.27,0:03:28.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ladylike Raki!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.65,0:03:29.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.87,0:03:43.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We were told that the Shandians'\Nrole had been fulfilled. - OG}We were told that the sacred duty\Nof the Shandians had been fulfilled.{Gord+Z, Viz, adds more to his zealot nature}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.12,0:03:47.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{And I'm sure your wish was\Ndelivered to your best friend as well. - OG}And I'm sure your best friend\Nheard your wish as well.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.50,0:03:53.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We no longer have to make\Nfuture generations shed blood. - OG}Future generations will no longer\Nneed to shed their blood.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.01,0:03:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The battle is over...\Nbut we won't lose our pride! - OG}Our fight may be over...\Nbut we will never lose our pride!{Polly+PP+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.59,0:04:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So please continue to watch over us.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.31,0:04:09.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We swear that we will not let the\Nfire of Shandia go out ever again! - OG}We swear to always keep\Nthe Light of Shandora shining!{Z+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.24,0:04:23.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I am the Sky Knight,\Na freelance soldier-for-hire. - OG}I am merely the Sky Knight,\Na freelance mercenary.{Naoto+PP+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.04,0:04:26.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You're the best suited for it. - OG}You are far better suited for it.{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.37,0:04:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This city belonged to your\Npeople from the start.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.67,0:04:31.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What's this all of a sudden? - OG}What's this now?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not a good reason.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.13,0:04:36.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{With this battle, I think\Neveryone must have realized... - OG}I think this battle\Ntaught us all the hard truth...{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.59,0:04:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{that no one can own Vearth. - OG}that no one can claim\Nownership of vearth.{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.97,0:04:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{"God" is our support. - OG}The title of "god" provides strength.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.39,0:04:47.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The name of the land is Skypiea.\NThe name of the city is Shandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only person who\Ncan unify them is you,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.02,0:04:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{who continued to be anguished\Nby the battle in this land. - OG}the one who's always anguished over\Nthis land's never-ending war.{PP+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sky Knight Gan Fall...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.49,0:05:01.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I would like\Nyou to take the seat of God again, - OG}I ask you to take the seat of god once more{Gord+Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.57,0:05:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{and support this land\Nwhose scar is still deep. - OG}and give this ailing nation\Nthe strength to heal.{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.50,0:05:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd like you to, as well!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.41,0:05:10.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Gan Fall-sama!- OG}Lord Gan Fall!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{If it's you, we'll accept it, too! - OG}As long as it's you,\Nwe're on board too!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.63,0:05:13.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.71,0:05:15.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gan Fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.21,0:05:16.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Please come back! - OG}We need you!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Honestly... - OG}Alas...{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.55,0:05:28.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Just when I thought I could finally\Nreally enjoy growing pumpkins... - OG}Just when I thought I could finally\Ngrow pumpkins in peace...{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.63,0:05:57.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone! We can see it now!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.38,0:06:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Please look to the\Nfront! It's Cloud End! - OG}Take a look ahead! It's Cloud End!{Gord+Spicy}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Ah! Let's see! - OG}Ah! Lemme see!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I see... So we can go\Nback down from there? - OG}Wow... So we can go\Nback down over there?{Gord+Spicy}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got here sooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{So we're going back down, huh? - OG}Do we have to leave already?{Gord, Viz - I like this much better}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.98,0:06:17.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, now that we're about to\Ngo back, I admit I hate to leave. - OG}Yeah, now that we're heading back,\NI don't want to say goodbye.{Gord, Viz-ish}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.69,0:06:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's time to say goodbye\Nto this pure white sea. - OG}It's time to say farewell\Nto this pure white sea.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.57,0:06:23.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The sky island was fun...\Nthough it was scary. - OG}The sky island was fun...\Nbut it was scary, too.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.20,0:06:28.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{So once we go through that gate,\Nwe'll be heading straight down - OG}{to the Blue Sea via\Na Milky Road, huh? - OG}{\q2}So there's a milky road through there that\Nheads straight down to the Blue Sea, huh?{Gord+Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.49,0:06:32.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I wonder if we can visit\Nthe sky island again... - OG}I wonder if we'll ever visit\Nthe sky island again...{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hard to tell with this place. - OG}Maybe, maybe not.{Gord, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.92,0:06:47.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well then, everyone! I'm sorry! We'll say goodbye here! - OG}Well then, everyone! I'm sorry,\Nbut we'll say goodbye here!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please take care, everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for seeing us off!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.72,0:06:54.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis{-chan}! Take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.39,0:06:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Say hello to the others! - OG}Send our regards to the others, too!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.65,0:07:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.69,0:07:07.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{No, we should be thanking you! - OG}No! We should be thanking you!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you all!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.49,0:07:14.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Conis, old guy and little\Nwhite one! You all take care! - OG}Conis, old guy, and fluff ball!\NYou all take care!{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.33,0:07:15.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yes! - OG}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.50,0:07:19.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, furl the sails immediately\Nand hold on tight to the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Alright! Do as the old guy said! - OG}Alright! Let's do as he says!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.09,0:07:23.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's gonna go pretty fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.97,0:07:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, we're sliding from a 7,000-meter height! Hurry up! - OG}Yeah, we're sliding 7,000\Nmeters down! Hurry!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.76,0:07:28.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Okay!\N– Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.93,0:07:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Wh-What?! What?! - OG}Wh-What?! Huh?!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He says, "Don't forget about me."
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.06,0:07:43.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Oh... That's the South Bird we\Nbrought to the sky with us. - OG}Oh... It's that south bird we\Nbrought to the sky with us.{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.24,0:07:48.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Now, Captain! - OG}Okay, Captain!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.95,0:07:51.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got the log for the next island!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.62,0:07:59.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah! Once we get off from here,\Nwe'll start on a new adventure again! - OG}Alright! Once we get back down,\Nwe'll start a brand new adventure!{Gord+PP+WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.25,0:08:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Guys! You ready?! - OG}You ready, guys?!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.67,0:08:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/fad(150,0)]We're gonna go back to the Blue Sea! - OG}{\fad(150,0)}We're going back to the Blue Sea!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.34,0:08:08.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.90,0:08:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Be careful while dropping!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.36,0:08:30.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{While dropping? - OG}– Dropping?\N– Dropping?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.58,0:08:41.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.42,0:08:50.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Here we go! The sky island's\Nfamous Octopus Balloon! - OG}Here we go! The sky island's\Nfamous octoballoon!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's an octopus! - OG}An octopus!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You son of a...!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.65,0:09:11.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Ow-ow... - OG}O-Ouch...{Gord+PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.82,0:09:14.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Wh-What?! What the...?! - OG}Wh-Wh-What the...?!{Gord, sounds more like 3 stutters to me}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! This is so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.25,0:09:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.75,0:09:24.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a balloon!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.04,0:09:26.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've slowed down!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.71,0:09:32.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... I thought that I was finally\Ngonna go to the netherworld.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.25,0:10:06.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Ring it! See off the saviors of\Nthis land by ringing the bell! - OG}Ring it! Let the ringing of the bell bid\Nfarewell to the saviors of this land!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.17,0:10:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.59,0:10:13.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Luffy! See you again! - OG}Luffy! Let's meet again!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Come visit us again! - OG}Don't be a stranger!{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.80,0:10:16.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.60,0:10:20.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Go back to the Blue Sea safely! - OG}Safe travels back to the Blue Sea!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.11,0:10:29.61,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{When you look up, you see the sky. - OG}When you cast your gaze\Ntoward the sky...{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.86,0:10:34.66,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{Is this God's Land on the\Nclouds a dream or reality? - OG}Is it real, or is it but a dream,\Nthis God Land above the clouds?{Polly+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.45,0:10:37.45,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{10,000 meters far up in the sky... - OG}Ten thousand meters high in the sky...{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.12,0:10:41.04,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{If you listen carefully, you\Ncan hear the sound of the bell. - OG}If you listen closely, you can\Nhear the sound of a bell.{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.96,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{It rings today, and it will\Nring again tomorrow. - OG}It rings today. And it will\Nring again tomorrow.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.92,0:10:47.29,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{The sound of the bell\Nthat echoes in the sky - OG}The echoing sound\Nof the bell in the sky{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.29,0:10:51.76,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{glorifies and sings about\Nthe wandering land... - OG}sings of the triumph of this\Nwandering land...{Polly+PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.60,0:11:02.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.43,0:11:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah! This feels so good! - OG}Yeah! This {\i1}is{\i0} great!{Gord+Spicy}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.15,0:11:10.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're calling off the search?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.98,0:11:14.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's just natural, right?! The\Ncity of gold was in the sky. - OG}It's only natural, right?!\NThe City of Gold was in the sky.{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.99,0:11:18.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We won't find anything\Nat the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.16,0:11:20.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.16,0:11:22.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no point in staying here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Old-timer... - OG}Boss...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Old-timer... - OG}Boss...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.17,0:11:33.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I really thank you all... for joining\Nme to pursue my dream for years. - OG}{\q2}I sincerely thank you all... for joining me\Nin pursuit of my dream all these years.{Gord+Z+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.84,0:11:35.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What're you saying...? - OG}What are you saying...?{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.30,0:11:37.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't treat us like strangers...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.64,0:11:38.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Say, you guys! - OG}Well then, gentlemen!{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.89,0:11:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What kind of romanticism\Nshall we go after next?! - OG}What sort of romantic adventure\Nshall we go after next?!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.90,0:11:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We'll follow you to the ends\Nof the earth, old-timer! - OG}We'll follow you to the ends\Nof the world, boss!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.28,0:12:03.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gold! Gold! Gold! Gold! Gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.79,0:12:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We've finally become super rich! What shall we buy?! - OG}We're finally super rich!\NWhat're we gonna buy?!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.92,0:12:11.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How about buying a huge bronze statue?! - OG}What about a huge bronze statue?!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.25,0:12:14.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You moron! What's the point of\Nexchanging gold with bronze?! - OG}You moron! Why would you\Ntrade gold for bronze?!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.59,0:12:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We should increase the\Nnumber of cannons! - OG}We should stock up on cannons!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's buy ten of them! Ten!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.18,0:12:21.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Nami-san! I want a\Nlockable refrigerator! - OG}Nami! I want\Na refrigerator with a lock!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.55,0:12:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid! What're we gonna\Ndo when we get hungry?! I object!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.60,0:12:25.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I... I... I want you to\Nbuy me some books!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.89,0:12:27.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's just why we should\Nbuy it, you dumb ass! - OG}That's why we should\Nbuy it, dumbass!{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]I want to read medical\Nbooks from other countries! - OG}{\an8}I wanna read medical\Nbooks from other countries!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.98,0:12:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey, hold on a second, you guys! - OG}Now hold on just a second, you guys!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.73,0:12:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll split the treasure once\Nwe get back down, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.23,0:12:35.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please buy books for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.57,0:12:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{If we buy whatever you guys like, I have a feeling that it won't do us any good. - OG}If we spend our money willy-nilly,\Nwe'll end up wasting it all.{Polly+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.62,0:12:52.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sun's completely set now.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.00,0:12:53.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{But it's a nice view. - OG}It's a nice view, though.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.59,0:12:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.77,0:13:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's cold...! - OG}It's freezing...!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.60,0:13:13.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami{-san}! Robin{-chan}! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.07,0:13:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That startled me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.44,0:13:21.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The octopus\Nsuddenly shrunk all the way! - OG}The octopus suddenly\Nshrank all the way!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I wonder if the air leaked out. - OG}Maybe it was an air leak.{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.82,0:13:24.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.24,0:13:30.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{But we somehow made\Nit down... without dying. - OG}Well, we somehow made\Nit down... without dying.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.33,0:13:32.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You! Thanks! - OG}Thanks a bunch!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.46,0:13:33.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we really went to an\Nincredible place, didn't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.38,0:13:44.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Now that we've fallen, it's so far up. - OG}Now that we're down here,\Nit seems so far away.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.43,0:13:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's as if we were dreaming. - OG}It's like we were dreaming.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.85,0:13:49.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a dream land. I wonder\Nif we can go visit again some day.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.31,0:13:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You might be able to\Nget closer if you die.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Zoro, so you think you\Ncan go to heaven? - OG}Zoro, do you really think\Nyou'll be allowed into heaven?{Z+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.86,0:13:57.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You jerk! - OG}Shut it!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.61,0:14:00.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well, things're calm now at any rate. - OG}At any rate, things have calmed down.{Naoto+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll make coffee or something.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'd rather have dinner, Sanji! - OG}Better yet, make us\Nsome dinner, Sanji!{Z+Spicy}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.99,0:14:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'm saying I'll get on it right away,\Nso have some coffee and wait! - OG}Yeah, yeah, I'll get right on it.\NJust sit tight and have some coffee.{Polly+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.79,0:14:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{And given all that gold, we'd each\Nhave gotten so much money! - OG}It's pirate loot,\Nso we'll divide it equally!{PP, OG line originally in the file was for a line that was cut}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.38,0:14:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Divided up?! - OG}We each get some?!{Gord, OG line originally in the file was for a line that was cut}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.00,0:14:16.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.92,0:14:18.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.38,0:14:21.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'm\Ngonna buy me a bronze statue! - OG}I'm gonna buy a bronze statue!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.01,0:14:22.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah! Can we buy books?! I\Nwant the latest medical books! - OG}Yeah! Can I buy books?!{PP, third sentence of line was cut}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.55,0:14:28.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{New pots and frying pans, plus\Nsilverware and giant mousetraps... - OG}New pots, frying pans, silverware,\Nand giant mousetraps...{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.06,0:14:30.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That leaves a crapload left over!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.56,0:14:32.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could drink all I want!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.73,0:14:35.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{First, my stash will be 80%! - OG}First, 80 percent goes to my stash!{Gord+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.94,0:14:37.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hold on a second! - OG}– Hold on a second!\N– Hold on a second!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.15,0:14:39.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.07,0:14:43.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Obviously! You can't just\Nopenly have a secret stash! - OG}Obviously! You can't have\Na public secret stash!{Spicy}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.11,0:14:49.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{By "stash," I mean money\Nsaved up to repair the ship! - OG}By "stash," I mean our\Nrepair fund for the ship!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.08,0:14:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The ship? You mean Merry? - OG}The ship? You mean {\i1}Merry{\i0}?{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.12,0:14:56.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's right. The Going Merry is\Nwhat brought us where we are now. - OG}That's right. The {\i1}Going Merry{\i0} is\Nwhat brought us all this way.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.29,0:14:57.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.84,0:15:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{it has given us a ride on the seas\Never since my East Blue village... - OG}{\q2}she's been our ride across the seas\Never since my village in the East Blue...{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.01,0:15:07.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's done so much for us,\Nbut now it's all beat up. - OG}She's done so much for us,\Nbut now she's all beat up.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.43,0:15:10.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good idea! The Great Repair\Nof the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.89,0:15:12.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm all for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Dig in. - OG}Alright, dig in.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.48,0:15:19.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. Usopp's cheap repairs\Nare just about at their limit. - OG}{\q2}Yeah, come to think of it, Usopp's\Ncheap repairs are just about at their limit.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.36,0:15:22.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'll have you know that I'm a sniper! - OG}Hey, I'm just a marksman, you know!{Polly+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.07,0:15:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{Yeah. We should go to\Na real shipbuilding dock and have real shipwrights fix it for us. - OG}Yeah. We should go to a real shipyard\Nand have real shipwrights fix it for us.{PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.95,0:15:32.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{There are people better than\Nyou at fixing ships, Usopp? - OG}People can fix ships\Nbetter than Usopp?{Spicy}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.66,0:15:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Sometimes you gotta\Ntake extra good care, - OG}We have to fix her up properly\Nfrom time to time,{PP+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.04,0:15:36.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{or you'll wind up paying for it later! - OG}or we'll pay for it later!{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.67,0:15:38.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{All right, it's decided! - OG}Alright, it's decided!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.58,0:15:40.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Let's get a shipwright in our crew! - OG}Let's add a shipwright to our crew!{Polly, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.59,0:15:43.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Our journey is far from over! - OG}We still have a long way to go!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.88,0:15:45.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yes! - OG}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!{Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.17,0:15:47.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We need those skills anyway... - OG}We need someone\Nwith those skills anyway.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.84,0:15:49.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{And Merry is our home! - OG}{\i1}Merry{\i0} is our home!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.35,0:15:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our life!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.97,0:15:55.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Let's find a shipwright\Nwho can keep it safe! - OG}Let's find a shipwright\Nwho can keep her safe!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There he goes again...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.27,0:16:03.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, on rare occasion,\Nhe gets straight to the point. - OG}Yeah, on rare occasion,\Nhe really hits the nail on the head.{PP+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.28,0:16:06.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's the best way! Let's do it! - OG}That'd be perfect! Let's do it!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.65,0:16:08.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, then that's the plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.03,0:16:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope we find someone good!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we need a musician, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.03,0:16:13.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{No, just forget about that. - OG}No, we really don't.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.04,0:16:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What's all the ruckus here?! - OG}What's all the ruckus?!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.34,0:16:23.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.34,0:16:27.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit pushing! W-We gotta\Nstay away from 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.05,0:16:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{They're having a falling out?! - OG}A falling out?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.19,0:16:42.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.31,0:16:43.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarquiss!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please! Make him stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.15,0:16:51.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Please! Stop! Why\Nare you doing this...?! - OG}Please! Just stop it!\NWhy are you doing this...?!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.53,0:16:53.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's happening?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.16,0:16:55.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Sarquiss is in pain! - OG}Sarquiss is the one begging to stop?{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.33,0:16:59.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why? Why, you ask?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarquiss... Bellamy...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.79,0:17:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's because you've tarnished\Nthis symbol of mine, of course. - OG}It's because you disrespected\Nmy flag, of course.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.84,0:17:13.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Does the sky island exist or not?"
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.10,0:17:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Is the City of Gold real or not?"
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.69,0:17:22.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I don't give a care about any of that. - OG}I couldn't care less about any of that.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.11,0:17:26.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You're to twist people around by\Ntaking advantage of differing opinions. - OG}"Pit belief against belief\Nto gain control over others."{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.19,0:17:28.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.82,0:17:30.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,wasn't it, Bellamy?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.16,0:17:35.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's... Donquixote Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.45,0:17:38.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's one of the Seven\NWarlords of the Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.08,0:17:40.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He used to have a\Nbounty over 300 million! - OG}His bounty used to be\Nover 300 million!{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.71,0:17:42.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's a guy like him doing here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.75,0:17:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't need useless punks\Nlike you serving under me...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.63,0:17:51.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap! My body's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.05,0:17:54.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop! Please, don't...!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.51,0:17:56.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.60,0:18:01.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.27,0:18:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,G-Give me...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.86,0:18:11.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give me one more chance...!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.65,0:18:16.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I–we– will follow you loyally! - OG}I'll... {\i1}We'll{\i0} be your loyal followers!{Gord+Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.62,0:18:17.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No more, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.62,0:18:25.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, I lost, but I never went\Nagainst your principles!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.58,0:18:27.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I swear on your symbol! - OG}I swear on your flag!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.21,0:18:29.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is just my way of doing things!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.88,0:18:32.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We couldn't just run 'im off; - OG}We couldn't just run him off!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.42,0:18:35.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{he would've reached you someday! - OG}He would've reached you someday!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.80,0:18:40.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How very touching, obedient\Nsubordinate of mine. - OG}{How very touching,\Noh faithful subordinate of mine. - Gord}How very touching,\NO faithful subordinate of mine.{Gord+Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.47,0:18:45.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I like about you, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.52,0:18:51.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{A "New Era" is just around\Nthe corner. Do as you wish. - OG}A new era is just around\Nthe corner. Do as you wish.{Naoto+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.24,0:18:56.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{But... I don't need you anymore. - OG}However... I don't need you anymore.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.41,0:19:02.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.13,0:19:11.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He took out the notorious Bellamy–\Na rookie worth 55 million– - OG}He just took out a notorious rookie\Nworth 55 million!{Gord+Polly}
