Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:43.28,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}When you're lost and alone, \Ncall out and lead me to your side
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:48.70,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}As you wander far from home, \Nyou search the sky and never hide
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:51.50,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}You are so much like the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:56.15,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Calmer than a star, your twinkling's lost
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:08.55,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}A deep reflection shines, you slowly leave, \Nfading, and what's the cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.61,0:20:13.78,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Stay as you are, don't lose your way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:22.09,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Let my words guide you, \Nand look ahead until the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.73,0:20:28.98,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Don't give up on your dreams, \Nthrough endless nights they come to you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:34.60,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}If you stop, you'll never see them shining through!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:40.37,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Will you return? Maybe not... \NWill you learn? I hope you do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.37,0:20:46.76,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Please put your past to rest, \Nand live your life anew.
